 9. Key takeaways
- AiTM steals the **session**, not just the password.
- The victim completes MFA normally, which is why the attack is convincing.
- **Phishing-resistant MFA** and **device-based Conditional Access** are the most effective defenses.
- Good logging and detection can catch token replay even when prevention fails.
